      "why": "Alleles are selected at residues in pairs with |dRRCS| >= 3.0 (single_gpcr_processor.py get_significant_positions, threshold=3.0), not at every contact-forming residue and not at the receptor-specific threshold. The selection itself is unchanged.",
      "kind": "literal",
      "after": " gnomAD missense variants at residues that take part in at least one contact pair with |ΔRRCS| ≥ 3.0 (a fixed cutoff, not the receptor-specific threshold), sorted by",
      "before": " gnomAD missense variants located at contact-forming residues, sorted by"
